## Code
- three.js r170 (MIT) from the Lemo-Opuscar library; post.js is a copy of the library's core/three/post.js.
- Engine: Lemo-Opuscar map-explainer demo (terrain meshes, baked low-sun shadows, data pillars, post); tools/bake.py,
  fetch_wide.py, prep_wide.py from the demo; fetch_patch.py / prep_patch.py adapted from the demo's fetch.py / prep.py.

## Images, models
- No photographs other than the satellite mosaic above, no 3D models, no AI-generated images. Pillars, pins and type are
  drawn in code. Silent clip: no audio.
